==Event Information==
All soldiers, battle stations!<br>
The {{Color|#9900FF|'''EVANGELION'''}} collab is back in The Battle Cats!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from December 5th (11:00am) until December 22nd (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#E97132|'''●EVANGELION Capsules, with a new series of Ubers!'''}}<br>
Collect special Battle Cats versions of your favorite EVANGELION characters in TWO special crossover Rare Capsule sets!<br>
Alongside the return of past collab heroes, new unit {{Color|#4EA72E|'''Mass Production EVA'''}} appears from the THE END OF EVANGELION film!<br>
Plus, {{Color|#A02B93|'''a new Legend Rare unit'''}} has been added to both Capsule sets!<br>
Grab collab-exclusive units while you can!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''Tap the banner in the Rare Capsules to check the available lineup of characters and their abilities!'''}}

※ During the crossover campaign period, you will have a set chance to collect one of the EVANGELION collab units from the EVANGELION / EVANGELION 2nd Strike capsule sets.<br>
※ Be aware that EVANGELION / EVANGELION 2nd Strike units can not be collected from other Rare Capsule sets. If you wish to draw collab units, please make sure that you have selected the EVANGELION or EVANGELION 2nd Strike Capsule set by tapping the icon at the top of the Rare Capsule Machine page.<br>
※If EVANGELION Collab Capsules fail to appear in the Rare Capsule Machine, make sure that you have updated the Battle Cats app to its most recent version.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・Limited Stages "EVANGELION Activates" & "Decisive Battle!"'''}}<br>
EVANGELION characters appear as foes in these dangerous stages! Prepare units with the {{Color|#0F9ED5|'''EVA Angel Killer'''}} effect and {{Color|#FF0000|'''increase your units' effectiveness'''}} with the skill before diving in!

{{Color|#4EA72E|'''All stage rewards have been reset'''}}, and {{Color|#9900FF|'''new stages have also been added!'''}}<br>
Visit the Stories of Legend/Event Stages during this collab event to challenge EVANGELION collab stages!

※ If Collab Stages do not appear, please update to the latest version of The Battle Cats app.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・New gauntlet stages from THE END OF EVANGELION film! Fight against the relentless assault of Mass Production EVA units!'''}}<br>
New limited collab stage Mass Production EVA Strikes has been added! Clear this stage to earn Catfruit and Catseyes!<br>
Can you stop the onrush of Mass Production EVA units through all 9 stages?!

※ Mass Production EVA Strikes is visible after clearing Empire of Cats Ch. 3 and is playable after clearing Into the Future Ch. 1.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・Limited Stages "EVANGELION Activates" & "Decisive Battle!"'''}}<br>
Clear the {{Color|#4EA72E|'''"EVANGELION Activates!"'''}} stage for a chance to receive the collab unit {{Color|#0000FF|'''Shinji & Cat'''}}!<br>
Higher-difficulty stages on this map offer a better chance to unlock Shinji & Cat! (Or you can use a Treasure Radar for a guaranteed chance to collect this unit!)<br>
Clearing {{Color|#33AAAA|'''"Decisive Battle!"'''}} will earn you huge XP rewards!

※ Activate Shinji & Cat by visiting the Rare Cats section of the Upgrade menu.<br>
※ Players who have already collected Shinji & Cat from a previous collab event will not be able to receive it again.<br>
※ Tap the Timed Score button at bottom left of the Map menu to check available rewards.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・Defend Tokyo-3 Against the Angel menace!'''}}<br>
The collab map {{Color|#33AAAA|'''"The 9th Angel Strikes!"'''}} with extra-tough stages will be available at the times listed below! Can you smash the cruel Angels and hold off Third Impact?<br>
・Odd Days (12/5, 12/7, 12/9, 12/11, 12/13, 12/15, 12/17, 12/19, 12/21)<br>
{{Color|#980000|'''12:00pm - 1:59pm / 9:00pm - 10:59pm'''}}

・Even Days (12/6, 12/8, 12/10, 12/12, 12/14, 12/16, 12/18, 12/20)<br>
{{Color|#980000|'''7:00am - 8:59am / 5:00pm - 6:59pm'''}}

・Last Collab Date (12/22)<br>
{{Color|#980000|'''7:00am - 10:59am'''}}<br>
Clearing these stages will give you a chance to collect the collab-exclusive character {{Color|#0F9ED5|'''Giraffe Unit-01'''}}!

Higher-difficulty stages on this map offer a better chance to unlock Giraffe Unit-01! (Or you can use a Treasure Radar for a guaranteed chance to collect this unit!)

※ If Collab Stages do not appear, make sure that you have updated the Battle Cats app to its most recent version<br>
※ Players who have already collected Giraffe Unit-01 from a previous collab event will not be able to receive it again.<br>
※ Tap the Timed Score button at bottom left of the Map menu to check available rewards.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・Challenge the Ultimate Refusal Type Angel!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#980000|'''6 days from the start of the collab (12/10/2025)'''}}, collab map {{Color|#4EA72E|'''"The 10th Angel Strikes!"'''}} will be available at the times listed below!<br>
・Odd Dates (12/11, 12/13, 12/15, 12/17, 12/19, 12/21)<br>
{{Color|#980000|'''7:00am - 8:59am / 5:00pm - 6:59pm'''}}

・Even Dates (12/10, 12/12, 12/14, 12/16, 12/18, 12/20)<br>
{{Color|#980000|'''12:00pm - 1:59pm / 9:00pm - 10:59pm'''}}

・Last Collab Date (12/22)<br>
{{Color|#980000|'''7:00am - 10:59am'''}}

Clearing these stages will give you a chance to collect the True Form of limited edition collab character {{Color|#00AA00|'''Kaworu & Cat'''}}!

※ Kaworu & Cat can be collected as a log-in bonus during the collab event.<br>
※Upgrade Kaworu & Cat to level 20 to unlock its True Form.<br>
※Higher-difficulty stages on this map will have a higher chance to unlock Kaworu & Cat's True Form!<br>
※Treasure Radar may be used on any stage for a guaranteed chance to receive Kaworu & Cat's True Form.<br>
※Players who have already collected Kaworu & Cat's True Form from a previous collab event will not be able to unlock it again.<br>
※ Tap the Timed Score button at bottom left of the Map menu to check available rewards.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・Gauntlet stages available from Day 6 of the collab! Stand firm against an ever-strengthening enemy horde!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#980000|'''From Day 6 of the collab (12/10/2025) at 11:00am'''}}, visit the Event/Legend Stages to challenge the collab gauntlet map {{Color|#4EA72E|'''Heralds of the End'''}}!

Heralds of the End can be challenged after clearing {{Color|#9900FF|'''EVANGELION Activates, Decisive Battle, The 9th Angel Strikes'''}}, and {{Color|#9900FF|'''The 10th Angel Strikes!'''}}

There are 20 stages total, and the enemies get stronger the further you go!

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・A weapon that should not exist! Face down the terrifying Unit-13!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#980000|'''After Day 7 of the collab (12/14/2025) at 11:00am'''}}, limited map {{Color|#4EA72E|'''"Unit-13 Strikes!"'''}} will be available at the times listed below!<br>
・Odd Dates (12/15, 12/17, 12/19, 12/21)<br>
{{Color|#980000|'''9:00am - 10:59am / 9:00pm - 10:59pm'''}}

・Even Dates (12/14, 12/16, 12/18, 12/20, 12/22)<br>
{{Color|#980000|'''12:00pm - 1:59pm / 7:00pm - 8:59pm'''}}

・Last Collab Date (12/22)<br>
{{Color|#980000|'''7:00am - 10:59am'''}}

Clear the stage for a chance to unlock {{Color|#0F9ED5|'''Shinji ＆ Cat's True Form!'''}}<br>
Only the precious bonds with your allies will lead you to victory over the awakened Unit-13!

※ Upgrade Shinji & Cat to level 20 to evolve to its True Form.<br>
※ Shinji & Cat can be collected from the "EVANGELION Activates!" stage.<br>
※ Higher-difficulty stages on this map will offer a better chance to unlock Shinji & Cat's True Form!<br>
※ Treasure Radar may be used on any stage for a guaranteed chance to receive Shinji & Cat's True Form.<br>
※ Tap the Timed Score button at bottom left of the Map menu to check available rewards.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・"Final Battle: EVA Unit-13" appears starting Day 11 of the collab!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#980000|'''From Day 11 of the collab at 11:00am'''}}, collab map {{Color|#0F9ED5|'''"Final Battle: EVA Unit-13"'''}} will become available! Clear this stage to earn Cat Tickets and Catseyes!<br>
Prepare yourselves for the final battle with Gendo!

※ The EVA Angel Killer will not have an effect on the EVA Unit-13 enemy appearing in this stage.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・"Bye-bye, all of the Cats" appears starting Day 13 of the collab!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#980000|'''From Day 13 of the collab at 11:00am'''}}, collab map {{Color|#0F9ED5|'''"Bye-bye, all of the Cats"'''}} will be available! Clear this stage to earn one Rare Ticket!
Team up with your Cats to create a world where EVA pilots are no longer needed!

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Limited Gamatoto Expedition Areas!'''}}<br>
EVANGELION themed Gamatoto areas {{Color|#4EA72E|'''NERV HQ'''}} ({{Color|#980000|'''December 5th (11:00am) until December 14th (10:59am)'''}}) and {{Color|#4EA72E|'''Near Third Impact'''}} {{Color|#980000|'''(December 14th (11:00am) until December 22nd (10:59am)'''}}) will be available only during this collaboration event!<br>
Don't miss out on bonus rewards - send your Gamatoto gang to these collab-exclusive areas before they disappear!

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Special collab missions in the Catnip Challenges!'''}}<br>
Take on Special Mission challenges and earn delightful bonus rewards by playing limited-time-only EVANGELION events!

※EVANGELION Special Missions will only appear in the Catnip Challenges until December 22nd, 2025 at 11am. You must accept all rewards before the mission disappears at the end of the Catnip Challenges event!

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Login each day for stamp rewards and a limited edition Cat Unit!'''}}<br>
Awesome login bonuses, available to collect only during this collab event!<br>
Visit The Battle Cats each day during this collab campaign and collect battle items and other rewards, and earn a Rare Ticket by picking up every stamp!<br>
Plus, your fifth Login Stamp will unlock the Special Collab Unit {{Color|#4EA72E|'''"Gendo & Fuyutsuki Cats"'''}}!<br>
Don't forget to login once every day or you'll miss out!

※ Once received, you can unlock "Gendo & Fuyutsuki Cats" by visiting the Special Cats section of the Upgrade menu.<br>
※ Players who have already collected "Gendo & Fuyutsuki Cats" from a previous collab event will not be able to unlock it again.<br>
※ There are 17 log-in stamps in total for this event.

For more information on EVANGELION, visit:<br>
https://www.evangelion.jp/<br>
